  s0: Request not seen
  s1: Cold cache observed
  s2: Caller told to send snapshot
  s3: Snapshot compiling
  s4: Snapshot rejected
  s5: Compilation failed
  s6: Snapshot ready, fence unused
  s7: Upstream execution in flight
  s8: Business result returned
  s9: Transport outcome uncertain
  s10: Execution entered again
  s11: Business result returned after duplicate entry
  s12: Transport outcome uncertain after duplicate entry
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: first execute sees the cache
  s1 --> s2: worker asks for the snapshot
  s2 --> s3: caller sends the snapshot once
  s2 --> s4: caller sends an invalid snapshot
  s3 --> s5: compilation fails
  s3 --> s6: compiled plan becomes ready
  s6 --> s7: worker takes the one-shot fence
  s7 --> s7: worker starts the business API call
  s7 --> s8: business response returns
  s7 --> s9: transport outcome becomes uncertain
  s8 --> s10: same request enters execution again
  s9 --> s10: same request enters execution again
  s10 --> s11: business response returns
  s10 --> s12: transport outcome becomes uncertain
